  "instructions": [
    "Evaluate only the displayed sentence and the intended kana reading. Do not consult source pool, current layer, japanese_quality, weirdness, or model-assisted v0.80 review before completing the first pass.",
    "The task is not to reward clever palindrome structure. Judge whether the Japanese works and whether this pattern should remain productive in the app.",
